# Agon is read-only for Cursor (Darren, 2026-11-06)

**Do not edit, create, delete, commit or push anything in this repository.** Agon is the public
framework, and Claude owns its architecture and design. Cursor owns **Primordial** (`../primordial`): the UI/UX,
the phone app and graphical clients, skin, art, audio and content.

- Reading this repository is fine: Primordial links it (`link:../agon/packages/*`), so read code and
  docs here to understand an API.
- When the game needs something from the framework (a new export, a rule change, a bug fix), **open an issue
  in KomplexMojo/agon labelled `api-request`**. Say what the game needs, why, and which module or
  `apiSurface` entry it touches. Claude picks it up.
- Keep this checkout on `main` and pulled. Do not leave a branch checked out here, because Primordial's tests
  and build read it.

Full rule: `AGENTS.md → Repository ownership`. The other rules in `.cursor/rules/` describe how Agon
is built. They help you read it, but they never license an edit here.
